      "statement": "runAgent replays the chat log before prompting: it rebuilds the session code content (checkpoint pins, epoch changes, accepted rows), the chatBindings name map (seeded from the checkpoint), per-gadget observed heads fixed at first observation so one turn sees a consistent tree even if mainline advances mid-turn, and the proposed-changes state — replay rehydrates recorded tool outputs instead of re-running them.",
