      "id": "claim_88d9339901524e5b81e30e221b83248b",
      "statement": "The system prompt is split into static and dynamic slots for provider prompt caching and folds in instance instructions, the workspace gadget registry and binding names, ambient capsule catalogs, connectable vendors, and standard output formats; the loop uses pi's runAgentLoopContinue with sequential tool execution, identity convertToLlm (replay already produces LLM-shaped messages), and a shouldStopAfterTurn that ends after the turn in which the abort fired or the turn cap hit.",
