      "id": "claim_d73dfcc249d8451fba431d8c30c7f07e",
      "statement": "The turn_end event is the persistence barrier: one transaction per completed model step persists the step's tool-call message together with its buffered code changes, created gadgets, and added bindings, making chat-content side effects durable iff the transcript record that explains them is durable; nothing from a failed or cancelled model request is persisted, and tool calls an abort pre-empted are recorded with the honest error 'Operation aborted'.",
