      "id": "claim_7b9f3ffcd9a1409daa353a80ad8df2c8",
      "statement": "The executeCode tool compiles the model's code into a dynamic worker (LOADER) alongside a fixed harness with disallow_importable_env and globalOutbound null so executed code cannot reach the internet or re-enter ctx.exports; env holds the chat's named bindings as loopbacks with caller {from:'agent', chatId}, a self stub calls back into the thread, per-callback resolve/reject pairs are passed as callbackResolvers, and logs are captured through a tail loopback raced against a 5s timeout with uncaught exceptions appended.",
