      "id": "claim_75908a7535dc499095695b5299e4148b",
      "statement": "The tool set is defined via defineTool in the tools record: file tools (readFile records observedCommit for staleness detection), executeCode, describeBinding (the prompt forbids guessing RPC APIs or enumerating env), createGadget (files into the chat's proposed changes), setGadgetBinding (provisional to the chat), listBlueprints, listConnectableResources/requestConnection, webFetch (agent-only, not callable from gadget code), observeUserChanges (never model-called; the system inserts synthetic calls on user edits), and giveUp added only for callback-initiated runs; spawned sub-agent chats get only describeBinding, executeCode, and giveUp.",
