      "statement": "The durable chat log distinguishes message (user/agent/gadget with toolCalls/capsules/attachments), slashCommand, changes (sequence-stamped agent step with createdGadgets/addedBindings), merge (through mergeThrough, possibly epochBoundary), revert, action (captured approval-queue id), useGadget, error, agentCallback, agentNudge, and connectionRequest; prepareChatBindings and chatScopeNames reconstruct claimed names from the log — simulating the replay loop's PARAMS_<n> allocation — so a newly named resource can never collide.",
