      "id": "claim_0d062e637ffd41d6a31e7b4bc814f150",
      "statement": "The webFetch tool does public-HTTPS GET only (no POST/PUT/DELETE, no credentials forwarded), relies on workerd's post-DNS global_fetch_strictly_public for SSRF protection (a hostname blocklist is deliberately unsound), converts supported documents to Markdown via WORKERS_AI.toMarkdown, caps bodies at 1 MiB default/5 MiB hard, and is a tool for the agent rather than something gadget code can call.",
